{"92:1:1":"By the night","92:1:2":"when","92:1:3":"it covers","92:2:1":"And the day","92:2:2":"when","92:2:3":"it shines in brightness","92:3:2":"created","92:3:3":"the male","92:3:4":"and the female","92:4:2":"your efforts","92:4:3":"(are) surely diverse","92:5:1":"Then as for","92:5:3":"gives","92:5:4":"and fears","92:6:1":"And believes","92:6:2":"in the best","92:7:1":"Then We will ease him","92:7:2":"towards [the] ease","92:8:1":"But as for","92:8:3":"withholds","92:8:4":"and considers himself free from need","92:9:1":"And denies","92:9:2":"the best","92:10:1":"Then We will ease him","92:10:2":"towards [the] difficulty","92:11:2":"will avail","92:11:4":"his wealth","92:11:5":"when","92:11:6":"he falls","92:12:3":"(is) the guidance","92:13:3":"(is) the Hereafter","92:13:4":"and the first (life)","92:14:1":"So I warn you","92:14:2":"(of) a Fire","92:14:3":"blazing","92:15:2":"will burn (in) it","92:15:3":"except","92:15:4":"the most wretched","92:16:1":"The one who","92:16:2":"denied","92:16:3":"and turned away","92:17:1":"But will be removed from it","92:17:2":"the righteous","92:18:1":"The one who","92:18:2":"gives","92:18:3":"his wealth","92:18:4":"(to) purify himself","92:19:2":"for anyone","92:19:3":"with him","92:19:5":"favor","92:19:6":"to be recompensed","92:20:1":"Except","92:20:2":"seeking","92:20:3":"(the) Countenance","92:20:4":"(of) his Lord","92:20:5":"the Most High","92:21:2":"he will be pleased"}
